r into a frog. This pack also includes many new house objects with which Sims can interact, including beehives, spinning wheels, butter churns, and other equipment that can be used to create spell ingredients.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-sims-makin-magic", "videos": [{"id": 52902, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "otb4vKfEBdU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=otb4vKfEBdU", "title": "The Sims Magic Town Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/otb4vKfEBdU/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 52904, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "yUtEjWDGRWo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yUtEjWDGRWo", "title": "The Sims Makin Magic commercial", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yUtEjWDGRWo/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 52901, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "nzP57w4HAjw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nzP57w4HAjw", "title": "The Sims Makin' Magic Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nzP57w4HAjw/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 52903, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Y1MPW8ny8OE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y1MPW8ny8OE", "title": "The Sims Makin Magic: Moody Gnomes", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Y1MPW8ny8OE/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 61, "name": "The Sims"}], "characters": [{"id": 1141, "name": "Voice Talent"}]}